<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ cuts computer companies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ cuts computer companies.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette removed Compaq Computer Corp and Dell Computer Corp from the recommended list, but maintained buy ratings on the stocks, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- DLJ also downgraded Gateway 2000 Inc, market sources said. One source said Gateway was cut to marketperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
